<td colspan=3 bgcolor="000000" class="windowbg2" valign=top><font size=2>Character Name:  Mustangg<br>Character Race:  Erudite<br>Character Class:  Wizard<br>Character Level:  69<br><br>Number of Alt Abilities (AAs):  234<br><br>Alternate Characters:  have 18 on 3 accounts.. but only one of merit is, kegean,   55 ranger, solro/ ep flagged.. <br><br>Hours of Play:  5 - 12pm m-f and most of the day on weekends<br><br>Time Zone:  EST<br><br>Previous Guild History:  CK for over 5 years, Dots(it broke up), NT(it is dieing)<br><br>Sponsors(if any):  Danyelle, Tiffanyy, Eronakis<br><br>Resists: no buffs - p 213 , m 160, d 141, f 153, c 162<br>           familiar only -  p 238, m 185,  d 166, f 179, c 187<br>           self buff/pet - p 273, m 185, d 201, f 239, c 247<br><br>Magelo: <a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=703416" target="_blank">http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=703416</a><br><br>Flags/Keys:  solro, ep, fire, chamber, seb, bot tower, aggy tower key, emp key, working VT, working VP, working to KT.<br><br>1.) Please acknowledge our Membership Agreement. Will you make a commitment to adopt our pledge which is twofold, a promise to ourself and to our fellow guild family?          I so pledge.<br><br>2.) What are you looking for in a guild? In your answer, please include how Halcyon meets your needs.<br><br>I was a member of Celestial Knights for over 5 years, It was very hard to leave CK, but it was and still is, a good small family guild, and I wanted to move on to the higher planes and the newer expansions.  I am looking for a guild that i can grow with, rather than a guild that will hand me the keys to time and KT and beyond.. I want to work for what I get, but get there, with family and friends.  I think that halcyon is a guild that is working for the same goals i am.<br><br>3.) What will you be contributing to Halcyon that qualifies you as an asset to our guild?<br><br>I work very hard on my character to get everything out of the game that I can.  I learn each zone and encounter, so that I know what is expected.  I can and have led Raids, and i have very high group leadership, to maximize the group during exp hunts and raids.   I have all my critical AAs to maximize damage output.. and am working on my second set of DD pets, to increase damage even more.<br><br>I am also working on becoming a GM in all tradeskills, and working on AG quest..   250 jewery, 250 brewing, 250 baking, 227 smithing, 221 pottery, 206 fletching, 204 tailoring.<br><br>4.) How did you hear about Halcyon? <br><br>I have many friends and acquaintances in Halcyon, and have learned much about the guild from them.<br><br>5.) Pirates or Ninjas?  Pirates<br> <br> &nbsp;<br></font></td>
</tr><tr>
