ot but as a tank i will need to contribute them.  The ability to be a team player<br><br>4.) How did you hear about Halcyon? <br>I was directed here when one of my last guilds Souls of Justice disbanded and they went to Grey Hawke<br><br>5.) Pirates or Ninjas?<br>pirates.....ARRR<br> <br> &nbsp;<br></font></td>
